*** Settings ***
Documentation     KEYWORD-DRIVEN tests for the User Registration (Signup) flow.
...               Demonstrates: Page Object Model, User Defined Keywords, Suite/Test
...               Setup & Teardown, and dynamically generated test data so the suite
...               can be re-run any number of times without clashing with accounts
...               created by earlier runs.
Resource          ../Resources/variables.resource
Resource          ../Resources/common.resource
Resource          ../PageObjects/HomePage.resource
Resource          ../PageObjects/LoginPage.resource
Resource          ../PageObjects/SignupPage.resource
Suite Setup       Open Application
Suite Teardown    Close Application
Test Teardown     Take Screenshot On Failure

*** Test Cases ***
Register A New User Successfully
    [Documentation]    Creates a brand new account with a unique, dynamically generated
    ...                email address, confirms the "Account Created!" message, then
    ...                deletes the account again so the suite leaves no data behind.
    [Tags]    registration    smoke    positive
    ${email}=    Generate Unique Email    prefix=newuser
    Open Login Page
    Input Signup Name And Email    Robot Framework User    ${email}
    Click Signup Button
    Wait Until Page Contains    ENTER ACCOUNT INFORMATION    timeout=${TIMEOUT}
    Fill Mandatory Account Details    password=Test@1234    day=10    month=5    year=1995
    Fill Address Details    first_name=Robot    last_name=Tester    address=221B Baker Street
    ...    state=West Bengal    city=Kolkata    zipcode=700001    mobile=9876543210
    Submit Create Account
    Account Should Be Created
    Click Continue After Account Creation
    User Should Be Logged In As    Robot Framework User
    [Teardown]    Run Keywords    Delete Test Account    AND    Take Screenshot On Failure

Registering With An Already Used Email Should Fail
    [Documentation]    NEGATIVE test: signing up twice with the same email address must
    ...                be rejected by the application with a clear error message.
    [Tags]    registration    negative
    ${email}=    Generate Unique Email    prefix=dupe
    Open Login Page
    Input Signup Name And Email    Duplicate User    ${email}
    Click Signup Button
    Wait Until Page Contains    ENTER ACCOUNT INFORMATION    timeout=${TIMEOUT}
    Fill Mandatory Account Details    password=Test@1234    day=1    month=1    year=1990
    Fill Address Details    first_name=Dup    last_name=User    address=Test Address
    ...    state=WB    city=Kolkata    zipcode=700001    mobile=9876543211
    Submit Create Account
    Account Should Be Created
    Click Continue After Account Creation
    Logout From Application
    Open Login Page
    Input Signup Name And Email    Duplicate User    ${email}
    Click Signup Button
    Signup Error Should Be Displayed
    [Teardown]    Cleanup Duplicate Test Account    ${email}    Test@1234
